# Text is stored with LF line endings and checked out that way everywhere:
# the shell scripts, the recipes and the man page must not get CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Captured output of package managers and the test corpus: bytes, never
# normalised (fixtures/README.md: nobody edits them by hand).
fixtures/** -text

# Binary.
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary

# Generated by cargo; shown collapsed in a diff on GitHub.
Cargo.lock linguist-generated=true
